NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE
This software is a research and decision-support tool. It is not investment
advice, and it is not a validated trading system. Its scores, rankings,
"expected edge", "expected return", and "confidence" figures are score-derived
diagnostics produced by heuristic rules and small samples. They are NOT
calibrated probabilities, NOT return forecasts, and NOT evidence of a
demonstrated trading edge. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss
and is not suitable for every investor. Any decision to trade is solely the
user's own, made at the user's own risk. See DISCLAIMER.md.
